  "strings": [
    "At last the Dark Lord's iron fist encircles the innocence of the Shire.\u0000",
    "There will be no escape for the Hobbits\u0000",
    "from the war that now enters their quiet borders.\u0000",
    "The last free men might attempt to aid them...\u0000",
    "but all must face an overwhelming enemy.\u0000",
    "Warg Riders and great war beasts mass for the attack...\u0000",
    "and none left alive can withstand their power.\u0000",
    "Perhaps at last the Dark Lord himself\u0000",
    "shall come forth to gloat in his triumph.\u0000",
    "Perhaps then with Gandalf we might sell our own lives most dearly.\u0000",
    "In desperation, Treebeard leads the Final March of the Ents.\u0000",
    "With their aid and with many Halfling archers, perhaps the Shire can resist...\u0000",
    "for a brief while.\u0000"
  ]
